            <p>You can combine evidence sources. For example: partial scholarship covering tuition, your own savings covering half the living costs, and a parental support letter for the remaining amount. Present all documents together with a cover letter explaining how each source contributes to meeting the threshold. The combined total must equal or exceed the consulate's requirement.</p>
