      <div class="msv__faq-list">
        <details>
          <summary>How much money exactly do I need for a Spain Student Visa?</summary>
          <div class="msv__faq-answer">
            <p>The Spanish government uses IPREM (the annual income index) to set the threshold. For 2026, this is approximately €599.67/month or €7,196 annually for a single student. This updates each January. Different consulates interpret this differently — some require the full year upfront, others accept 3–6 months of recent bank statements. Check with your specific consulate for their exact requirement.</p>
